  "unresolved": [
    "Natural scheduling into the typed origin 722 is not established: what hands off to 27C1A.MES is not established here.",
    "The callee asks no question; it writes the date word banked_u16[264] = state_u16[7] (for the next block), closes global_u8[1757] (its own done-gate) and global_u8[1755] -- both conjuncts of the guard -- and stamps banked_u16[242] = 27 (a literal). No banked_u16[200..215] affection word is moved by this callee.",
    "state_u16[8] is written 0 at 277 immediately before the 282/337/392 ladder reads it, and global_u8[4000] reads 0 at the callee's own branch (511) even when seeded 1 -- reset inside a shared routine the trace does not record.",
    "global_u8[2847] and global_u8[3006] are read nowhere in this callee (confirmed by static decode and by the 2847-1/3006-1 variants, which change nothing).",
    "FLOOR1.MES past the door is not measured.",
    "done_cell = the guard's cleared flag the event sets",
    "effect on banked_u16[264] for result result_default: variants with the same entry state end on different final values [401, 501, 615] (non-deterministic replay)",
    "effect on global_u8[4000] for result result_default: witness outcome 'other', not set/add"
  ]
}
